00:04:50.878 --> 00:04:52.377
and she didn't wanna be in it.

00:04:52.377 --> 00:04:54.030
And so, then we landed on me

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:55.440
and then we landed on David.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:56.523
- Okay, right on.

00:04:57.502 --> 00:04:58.335
- So, yeah.
- Oh my gosh.

00:04:58.335 --> 00:05:00.630
First of all, I wanna hold
back conversation on that

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:03.456
off camera, but who says no to Meg Ryan.

00:05:03.456 --> 00:05:04.289
Cool, okay.

00:05:04.289 --> 00:05:06.060
