You go the whole scope of it, man.

00:15:32.553 --> 00:15:33.386
You're a big thinker.

00:15:33.386 --> 00:15:34.219
I am very literal,

00:15:35.683 --> 00:15:37.710
in a complimentary way.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:39.981
No, I mean, I mean it as a compliment.

00:15:39.981 --> 00:15:40.950
(audience laughing)

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:42.660
I, no, I mean like you
like think of so much

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.587
in one question.

00:15:44.587 --> 00:15:46.440
I'm like, I'm just like, I don't know.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:48.365
Would you go to space or not?

00:15:48.365 --> 00:15:50.690
I'm so, like, you're Yale
and I'm high school graduate.

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:52.650
(everyone laughing)

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:53.483
That's the difference.

00:15:53.483 --> 00:15:55.348
- I would love to be in
therapy with you too.

00:15:55.348 --> 00:15:57.360
(everyone laughing)

00:15:57.360 --> 00:15:58.503
- You probably would.

00:15:59.427 --> 00:16:00.417
You wouldn't have to talk.

00:16:00.417 --> 00:16:01.250
(everyone laughing)

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.637
All right, those are our deal breakers.

00:16:03.637 --> 00:16:04.560
- Therapist would be like
what's the guy's name again?

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.393
- You came with-

00:16:06.305 --> 00:16:07.625
- Oh, David, hey, okay.

00:16:07.625 --> 00:16:08.458
(everyone laughing)

00:16:08.458 --> 00:16:09.291
- Oh, he's here.

00:16:09.291 --> 00:16:11.520
Okay, everybody go see
"What Happens Later".

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.290
It's incredible and
it's thought provoking,

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.067
which is the best kind of movie.

00:16:15.067 --> 00:16:15.900
(audience applauding)

00:16:15.900 --> 00:16:17.490
It will leave you asking
so many questions.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:18.930
We'll be right back.

